    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wyse Residential proudly presents Apartment 54, 35 Mountjoy Square to the market. This appealing two bedroom apartment is situated on the second floor and overlooks the historic Mountjoy Square. This attractive apartment comprises of two bedrooms, one bathroom, main living and dining room and kitchen. Additionally, the property benefits from a designated car parking space, which is located in the development's underground car park.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 1999, the development incorporates a historical Georgian building and is ideally located in the centre of the Georgian Quarter of Dublin 1. There are a host of amenities nearby in Dublin City including shops, restaurants and cafes on Henry Street, O'Connell Street and Capel Street, which are all located within a leisurely stroll of the property. The property is well served by public transport including multiple bus routes at Mountjoy Square, the Dart and Train at Connolly and Drumcondra stations and the Luas is easily accessed at available at Parnell Street."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: 2.71m x 1.97m \r\nWelcoming entrance hallway with hot press.  \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room: 3.00m x 2.97m/ 2.98m x 2.82m \r\nBright and spacious room with feature fireplace. \r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.50m x 1.74m \r\nFitted units incorporating washer/dryer, fridge, oven, hob, extractor fan and sink. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.02m x 2.31m \r\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  3.00m x 1.97m \r\nSingle bedroom with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom:  2.31m x 1.69m \r\nPartially tiled incorporating a bath with shower fitting, wc and whb."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-An appealing two bedroom, two bathroom apartment located on the second floor, overlooking Mountjoy Square.\r\n-Conveniently located within a short stroll of a host of amenities in Dublin 1.\r\n-One designated underground car parking space.\r\n-Electric central heating.\r\n-Current annual service charge is €3,335."
      },
      {
